    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Descent is a story flatformer game about a girl who has fallen from this world to hell on her journey to escape from hell. It is story about girl meeting bosses who symbolize the seven sins in hell, and going through adversity and escaping with Karma Gauge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Keywords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma Gauge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Karma Gauge is similar to your heart rate in real life. You can faint if the levels are too high. But in hell, you don't just faint because your heart beats fast, but because of the fear and memory in this world. Escape from hell while keeping the Karma Gauge not too high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a sin skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will learn about unique skills whenever you encounter bosses who symbolize seven sins. Use the skills you learned to pass through the stage! Also, try to strengthen your skills with the points you get each time you defeat a boss.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Descent is a story flatformer game about a girl who has fallen from this world to hell on her journey to escape from hell. It is story about girl meeting bosses who symbolize the seven sins in hell, and going through adversity and escaping with Karma Gauge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Keywords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma Gauge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Karma Gauge is similar to your heart rate in real life. You can faint if the levels are too high. But in hell, you don't just faint because your heart beats fast, but because of the fear and memory in this world. Escape from hell while keeping the Karma Gauge not too high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a sin skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will learn about unique skills whenever you encounter bosses who symbolize seven sins. Use the skills you learned to pass through the stage! Also, try to strengthen your skills with the points you get each time you defeat a boss.</p>",
    "short_description": "Story flatformer about a girl's journey to escape from a museum called Hell. Will she be able to escape hell by passing the bosses who represent the seven sins in hell with Karma Gauge....",
